    "s1": {
      "x": 4120,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "Start at Cat list and click through — every screen is linked.\n\nThe cat list toggle actually works: untick Include deceased and Ash disappears.\n\nWhat to look at first:\n• The profile header. It sits in the layout, so every tab carries the allergy list and the high-risk warning.\n• Mittens vs Biscuit — allergies present vs \"None recorded\".\n• The two confirm dialogs. Each states exactly what will happen, rather than \"Are you sure?\".",
      "color": "teal",
      "size": "m"
    },
    "s2": {
      "x": 4120,
      "y": 2600,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "Current / Due soon / Overdue each carry an icon and a word, never colour alone — WCAG 2.1 AA (UI-6).\n\nOverdue states the boarding consequence, because that is the decision the status exists to drive (BR-1).",
      "color": "orange",
      "size": "m"
    }
  }
